<title>USA: Ethika Corp says merger talks with TSG end.</title>
<headline>Ethika Corp says merger talks with TSG end.</headline>
<dateline>HILTON HEAD ISLAND, S.C. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethika Corp said Monday merger talks with TSG Holdings Inc have been terminated by mutual agreement after the two companies were unable unable to reach agreement on final terms of an acquisition.</p>
<p>On May 15, the companies signed a letter of intent that allowed for the possible acquisition of TSG by Ethika.</p>
<p>Ethika said it continues to seek additional acquisitions of applied technology companies that have high-growth potential.</p>
</text>
